MOXA-DEV-AUTOLOGIN
==================

Development-only rootfs overlay. Drops the serial console (ttyS0, 115200)
straight into a root shell with no username or password prompt.

Used only by moxa/configs/mdsg4000l34xgs_autologin_defconfig. No release
defconfig references this directory.

To find every trace of it:   grep -rl MOXA-DEV-AUTOLOGIN <buildroot>
To remove: delete this directory and the autologin defconfig, then rebuild.
